BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (The Tessera TS-4 gateway is the site hub of the Tessera vibration-monitoring platform. It forms) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (and manages a TesseraMesh wireless network of up to 64 TS-4e edge nodes, buffers their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (readings, and forwards them securely to TesseraCloud. The gateway is available in two variants) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (that differ only in backhaul: TS4-GW-LTE, with LTE Cat-M1 cellular and Ethernet, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (TS4-GW-ETH, with Ethernet only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (Typical applications include pump stations, cooling-water systems, HVAC plant rooms, conveyors) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (and process fans, where running a cable to every sensor would be costly or impractical.) Tj ET
