BT /F1 9 Tf 54 400 Td (Typical consumption | 6.5 W \(11 W peak\) | 4.0 W) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 388 Td (Store-and-forward buffer | 256 MB flash, approx. 30 days at 64 nodes | 256 MB flash, approx. 30) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 376 Td (days at 64 nodes) Tj ET
